WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.210
Eight. Explore a themed photo shoot around the real product.

2
00:00:05.210 --> 00:00:13.515
Start with product photos, a theme and a styling direction. For example: a winter jacket, in an evening street setting.

3
00:00:13.515 --> 00:00:21.220
Choose the model direction and shot list. Generate candidates for the looks, angles and details the campaign needs.

4
00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:32.145
Compare every candidate with the garment reference. Check colour, logos and consistency. The stylist approves the contact sheet before channel exports.

5
00:00:32.145 --> 00:00:39.170
The opportunity is faster exploration of campaign imagery, while keeping the product truthful.

6
00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:48.870
One local scene swap has been demonstrated. The full studio and try-on remain trials; published work needs a licensed production model.
